1810 GOSUB 6370:BM$="Hroth: The other kings were supposed to be our allies, and yet they point\their spears at our starving people, drive us away... How could this be?":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1820 GOSUB 6380:BM$="Susanna: They were allies only when it was convenient for them. We must\leave their domain, and find a new land to call our own.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
