1840 BM$="Hroth: But He cast me off to Hell, alongside my subjects. He chose the King\of the North, forsaking us. He left me no choice. I must become the Devil\King, and use the forbidden arts to fight God.":GOSUB 5100
1850 BM$="Hroth: Susanna! I will become the Devil King, and fight God. As long as my\blood persists, I will resurrect as the Devil King, and sever the blood of\the northern tribes.":GOSUB 5100
1860 BM$="Hroth: I thus swear upon the star of darkness: no matter how many\centuries, how many millennia it takes, when the star of darkness shines\once more, the Devil King shall rise from the blood, and exact his":GOSUB 5100:BM$="vengeance upon the northern tribes.\Susanna, be the eternal recipient of my blood.":GOSUB 5100
